# Beatrix, Dawnbreak Soldier

> Beatrix is four marksmen stuffed into one hero, and most of her losses come from players bringing the wrong one to a fight. Her passive ties Spell Vamp directly to her Lifesteal, which turned her ultimate into a sustain tool. That changes the build, it does not change the draft rules: she still folds the moment the enemy has a hard answer to backline play.

