## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-06. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Gold Lane Range Burst (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Blade of Despair, Hunter Strike, Haas's Claws, Sea Halberd, Malefic Gun
- Core: Blade of Despair, Hunter Strike, Malefic Gun
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Wind of Nature over Sea Halberd when Use when the main threat is physical burst and the enemy does not rely on heavy healing or shields.; Rose Gold Meteor over Sea Halberd when Use against mixed dive or magic burst where Wind of Nature does not stop the first engage.; Immortality over Haas's Claws when Use in the final Lord fight when one death decides the game and your team can protect the revive.
- Total cost: 11920 gold

Default gold lane setup for Renner and Bennett pressure, rushing raw Physical Attack and penetration before Malefic Gun extends Beatrix's safe damage range.

### Attack-Effect DPS (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Golden Staff, Malefic Gun, Wind of Nature
- Core: Demon Hunter Sword, Corrosion Scythe, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Sea Halberd over Wind of Nature when Use when sustain, shields, or high-extra-HP fighters are more dangerous than physical burst.; Rose Gold Meteor over Wind of Nature when Use against magic burst or mixed assassins that can force Wind Chant too early.
- Total cost: 10970 gold

Sustained DPS setup for Nibiru and Wesker games where Beatrix can keep basic-attacking and convert attack effects into front-to-back pressure.

### CC-Safe Late Game (Gold)

- Items: Tough Boots, Blade of Despair, Malefic Gun, Haas's Claws, Rose Gold Meteor, Immortality
- Core: Blade of Despair, Malefic Gun, Rose Gold Meteor
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Wind of Nature over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when the decisive threat is physical damage after crowd control has already been answered by Purify.; Athena's Shield over Immortality when Use against single-window magic burst that must be blocked before revive value matters.; Radiant Armor over Immortality when Use against repeated magic damage that chips Beatrix through extended objective fights.
- Total cost: 11790 gold

Defensive setup for CC-heavy drafts where Beatrix needs Purify, Tough Boots, and one lifeline item to keep range long enough to fire.

